// Floor at 1.26.5 (ADR-060): the embedded Bento connector library
// (warpstreamlabs/bento v1.19, landed in outbound-connectors in slice C4b) declares
// `go 1.26.5`, which propagates the language version to that module and therefore to
// the workspace. The workspace `go` directive must be >= every module's, so it sits at
// 1.26.5.
go 1.26.5

// 🔑 THE TOOLCHAIN IS PINNED SEPARATELY FROM THE LANGUAGE FLOOR, AND THEY MOVE FOR
// DIFFERENT REASONS. The `go` line above is a floor set by what our modules declare and
// it changes when a dependency raises it. This line is which compiler actually builds —
// it changes when a Go patch release fixes something we ship, which is a security
// cadence, not a dependency one. Conflating them is how a stdlib CVE fix gets blocked on
// an unrelated language-version argument.
//
// At 1.26.6 for seven reachable standard-library advisories — GO-2026-5026, -5972,
// -6088, -6089, -6090, -6091 and -6218, across net/http, crypto/tls, encoding/asn1,
// encoding/xml, html/template and net/url — all fixed in this patch release.
//
// 🔴 THIS IS THE CHECK THAT GOES RED WITHOUT ANYONE TOUCHING THE CODE. govulncheck reads
// a LIVE advisory database, so the same commit that passed this morning fails this
// afternoon when an advisory lands. A red govulncheck on a PR therefore says nothing
// about that PR until you have checked whether main is red too — here every failing
// module was failing on code the PR never touched, including one byte-identical to main.
toolchain go1.26.6

use (
	./backend/cli
	./backend/core
	./backend/edge/dc-edge-agent
	./backend/k8s
	./backend/services/ai-inference
	./backend/services/command-delivery
	./backend/services/dashboard-management
	./backend/services/device-management
	./backend/services/device-state
	./backend/services/event-management
	./backend/services/event-processing
	./backend/services/event-sources
	./backend/services/lwm2m-ingest
	./backend/services/mcp
	./backend/services/notification-management
	./backend/services/outbound-connectors
	./backend/services/sparkplug-ingest
	./backend/services/user-management
	./backend/sims/dc-simulator
	./backend/tools/apiprobe
	./backend/tools/drdrill
	./backend/tools/migrationdiff
	./backend/tools/subconfirm
	./deploy
)
